	(text "RV-3032-C7: backup switchover is DISABLED on delivery. Configure once with valid VDD:\nSet EERD=1 (10h bit 2), then wait for EEbusy=0 (0Eh bit 2) before changing configuration.\nWrite C0h RAM mirror: BSM=10 (LSM), TCM=00 (charger OFF for CR1220); optionally NCLKE=1.\nPersist with EECMD (3Fh)=11h; wait at least 10 ms, then poll EEbusy=0 and check EEF.\nFinally clear EERD=0. Do not rewrite EEPROM on every boot."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 85.09 59.69 0)
		(effects
